---
title: LoggingOptIn · when logging runs
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> NewHome
  [*] --> ExistingHome
  NewHome --> Off : install / up [unset]
  ExistingHome --> On : first start saves on
  Off --> On : up --logging
  Off --> On : config true, then up
  On --> Stopped : up --no-logging
  On --> Stopped : config false, then up
  Stopped --> On : up --logging
  On --> Down : global down
  Down --> On : up [on]
  Stopped --> Wiped : logs-reset
  Down --> Wiped : logs-reset
  Wiped --> On : up --logging
  note right of Off
    No logging files written.
    hack logs reads container
    logs; --loki says how to
    turn it on.
  end note
  note right of Stopped
    INV NoSurpriseDataLoss: off
    stops this home's containers
    (found by Compose labels) and
    keeps their volumes.
  end note
  note left of ExistingHome
    A failed save warns and this
    run still follows the choice;
    routing is not blocked.
  end note
  note left of NewHome
    INV FreshNeverStartsUnasked:
    install writes the logging
    files only while on.
  end note
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef idle stroke-dasharray:4 3
  class On ok
  class Off,Stopped,Down,NewHome,ExistingHome,Wiped idle
